  "markup": {
    "panel": "<form class=\"wb-handle\"><div class=\"wb-handle-head\"><div><h2>处理任务</h2><p>远川精密 · <span class=\"wb-handle-due\">已逾期 2 天</span></p></div></div><div class=\"wb-handle-body\"><p class=\"wb-handle-task\"><span>任务内容</span>约王卓评审方案初稿</p><fieldset class=\"wb-handle-modes\"><legend>选择处理方式</legend><label class=\"wb-handle-mode wb-handle-mode-complete\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\" checked><b>完成任务</b><span>记一条跟进</span></label><label class=\"wb-handle-mode wb-handle-mode-cancel\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"mode\"><b>取消任务</b><span>写明原因</span></label></fieldset><fieldset class=\"wb-handle-fields\"><div class=\"wb-handle-row\"><label class=\"wb-handle-label\">办理结果 <em>*</em></label><textarea></textarea></div><div class=\"wb-handle-row\"><div class=\"wb-handle-inline\"><div class=\"wb-handle-chips\"><label class=\"wb-handle-chip\"><input type=\"radio\"><span>电话</span></label><button class=\"wb-handle-chip-btn\" type=\"button\">明天</button></div><span class=\"wb-handle-note\">执行人：本人</span></div></div><details class=\"wb-handle-more\"><summary>补充</summary></details><p class=\"wb-handle-sum\">提交后：……</p><p class=\"wb-handle-empty\">没有可用的处理方式</p></fieldset></div><div class=\"wb-handle-foot\"><button class=\"wb-btn primary\" type=\"submit\">完成任务</button></div></form>"
  },
